The '''Far Reserve''' is a section of the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}. It connects to the {{Zone|Rampart's Quarry}}, {{Zone|Upper Mines}}, and {{Zone|Goblin Burrows}}.

== Overview ==
The '''Far Reserve''', similar to most other mining area in the Dwarven Mines, consists largely of veins of {{Item|Mithril}} and several wooden platforms that allow the player to reach higher levels of the area.

A {{NPCSprite|Ticket Master}} can be found in the '''Far Reserve'''. The [[Raffle]] event can occur here, as well as [[Fallen Star]]s.

